<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link><description>World News Today: Read the latest world news headlines, Current International breaking news world wide. In depth analysis and top news headlines world wide.</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-08-19T15:03:23+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/296589292.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Wed, 19 Aug 2026 15:03:23 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link></image><item><title><![CDATA[Meet Kanav Jain: Scottish student who built a low-cost autonomous aircraft to deliver medicines to remote communities]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133343547.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Kanav Jain, a talented Scottish student, has been awarded the prestigious UK Young Engineer of the Year for creating AeroAid, an innovative low-cost autonomous drone aimed at delivering medical supplies. This versatile VTOL quadplane combines the best features of helicopters and airplanes, making it ideal for reaching remote locations. Jain’s mission is to leverage technology for vital humanitarian assistance, reflecting his commitment as a leader in drone technology workshops.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/meet-kanav-jain-the-scottish-student-who-built-a-low-cost-autonomous-aircraft-to-deliver-medicines-to-remote-communities-it-made-him-uk-young-engineer-of-the-year/articleshow/133343547.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/meet-kanav-jain-the-scottish-student-who-built-a-low-cost-autonomous-aircraft-to-deliver-medicines-to-remote-communities-it-made-him-uk-young-engineer-of-the-year/articleshow/133343547.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-19T15:01:36+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133343609,imgsize-121771.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Spanish woman trains 18 rescued donkeys to help prevent wildfires]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133328932.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/a-spanish-woman-turned-18-rescued-donkeys-into-a-wildfire-fighting-team-with-the-animals-grazing-for-up-to-7-hours-a-day-her-unusual-conservation-idea-is-helping-prevent-fires-before-they-start/articleshow/133328932.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/a-spanish-woman-turned-18-rescued-donkeys-into-a-wildfire-fighting-team-with-the-animals-grazing-for-up-to-7-hours-a-day-her-unusual-conservation-idea-is-helping-prevent-fires-before-they-start/articleshow/133328932.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-19T15:01:24+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133328994,imgsize-214753.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Queen Camilla says she nearly revealed King Charles III’s cancer diagnosis]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133342897.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/queen-camilla-says-she-nearly-revealed-king-charles-iiis-cancer-diagnosis-days-before-palace-announcement/articleshow/133342897.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/queen-camilla-says-she-nearly-revealed-king-charles-iiis-cancer-diagnosis-days-before-palace-announcement/articleshow/133342897.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-19T14:34:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133343062,imgsize-662532.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Between 1969 and 1972, US released a weevil to fight musk thistle; it later attacked native thistles]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133342649.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A biological control initiative aimed at managing invasive thistles integrated a weevil specifically targeting musk thistle. Unfortunately, this insect extended its reach to native plant species, leading to detrimental effects on local thistles, including an endangered variety that experienced a decline in seed production. This situation underscores the critical importance of careful evaluation in invasive species control programs.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/between-1969-and-1972-the-us-released-a-european-weevil-to-fight-invasive-musk-thistle-it-later-attacked-at-least-25-native-thistles-including-rare-and-endangered-species/articleshow/133342649.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/between-1969-and-1972-the-us-released-a-european-weevil-to-fight-invasive-musk-thistle-it-later-attacked-at-least-25-native-thistles-including-rare-and-endangered-species/articleshow/133342649.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-19T14:25:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133342751,imgsize-1670890.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A 2,500-year-old sacred well in Italy hid bronze offerings and two human skeletons]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133342462.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Archaeologists found an unusual ritual well at ancient Etruscan city Kainua in Italy.  Two bronze statuettes and a rare bronze plate were discovered at the well's bottom.  These objects were votive offerings placed during a foundation ritual centuries ago.  Two adult human skeletons were also found, marking the structure's ritual closing.  The findings offer new insights into Etruscan city foundations and religious traditions.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/a-2500-year-old-sacred-well-in-italy-hid-bronze-offerings-and-two-human-skeletons-from-an-ancient-etruscan-ritual/articleshow/133342462.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/a-2500-year-old-sacred-well-in-italy-hid-bronze-offerings-and-two-human-skeletons-from-an-ancient-etruscan-ritual/articleshow/133342462.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-19T14:14:45+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133342567,imgsize-230431.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Trump claims over 24,000 noncitizens voted illegally in 2020]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133342086.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trump-claims-over-24000-noncitizens-voted-illegally-in-2020/articleshow/133342086.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trump-claims-over-24000-noncitizens-voted-illegally-in-2020/articleshow/133342086.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-19T14:10:15+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133342405,imgsize-66298.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Disney built Disneyland around a family farm that refused a $90 million offer]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133322553.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[For decades, the Fujishige family refused to sell their 58-acre farm in Anaheim, even as Disneyland and surrounding development transformed the area. Disney and other developers made repeated offers for the valuable land, but the family continued growing strawberries and vegetables. After years of pressure and a bitter fight with the city, the family finally agreed to sell in 1998, shortly before Hiroshi Fujishige died. The former farm later became the Toy Story parking lot at Disneyland.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1953-a-california-family-bought-a-58-acre-berry-farm-for-3500-decades-later-they-reportedly-refused-a-90-million-offer-from-disney-and-kept-farming-beside-disneyland/articleshow/133322553.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1953-a-california-family-bought-a-58-acre-berry-farm-for-3500-decades-later-they-reportedly-refused-a-90-million-offer-from-disney-and-kept-farming-beside-disneyland/articleshow/133322553.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-19T14:19:48+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://s